You are confusing carriers with the originating site.  There are obviously
doubts about whether pipex, uunet etc. are publishers, but as I understand
it there are less or no doubts that the site at which the posting originated
(ie.  the site giving access to the writer of the defamatory words) is
a publisher in addition to the writer for the purposes of libel actions.
The same is true for sites giving access to the defamatory words
to end-users, in just the same way as a magazine vendor can be sued for 
in the UK for libelous material carried by the magazines he sells.

Laurence

